# Vercel Deployment Optimization Ignore for Next.js app
# Prevents raw 3D assets, DCC project files, and backups from inflating deployment storage

# Raw 3D authoring formats
*.max
*.blend
*.c4d
*.ma
*.e3d
*.pdf

# Backups and temporary files
*backup*.html
temp_*
scratch_*
archive/
*.log

# Duplicate references
public/assets/references/
public/assets/README.md
